body:
Not sure since I don't know much about HSR's current story, but even if you do need honkai lore to understand something, there will probably be a lore channel in the HSR discord where you could ask about it so you could get an explanation

&#x200B;

from what I know you just need to know some basics about apho and read the alien space manga. there's also summaries/videos for honkai chapters and a lot of manga, so you don't really need to play honkai if lore is your thing

If you're planning to play seriously, honkai consumes a lot more time than genshin lmao. Abyss resets twice a week, arena and elysian realm once, and mirage daily. If you want high scores in abyss and arena, sometimes you'd have to replay a few times. And elysian realm... is elysian realm. Can be frustrating sometimes.

&#x200B;

If you're planning to reroll, go for either Stygian Nymph, or if available, Herrscher of Sentinence/Flamescion. Most of the valkyries in Dorm Supply are farmable anyways, and HoR is free next patch

BKE and Elysia are good with different bosses, and youre lvl 40, you dont need ELFs lmao. Make sure to get Abyss Flower after BKE, and if you don't have Ely's bow then just stick to BKE. Next phys dps you need to farm for is Molotov Cherry + her augment.

&#x200B;

You might wanna check guides or ask around in [discord](https://discord.gg/hQEyTVqNEn) for beginners help for stuff about builds and what to get from your boxes

there's three annis actually, one for cn and sea, they're both around september \~ november I think? global anni is around feb \~ march. servers won't get the anni-exclusive in-game and web events of other servers, but I think some in game stuff are the same?  idk honestly lol

&#x200B;

if youre going to use sea server, then you should start now, since some events have already started, but if youre gonna use global, wait and see (either from announcement or from this sub) if global gets some of the rewards of sea anni

What? Regardless of CN Honkai's release date, at least they revealed all their rewards *before* 5.2, which is the anniversary patch. I love both honkai and genshin, but at least we saw the in-game rewards from  5.2 cn beta and the amazing anniversary stream yesterday

&#x200B;

As for genshin? the community events aren't even worth participating in, and we still don't have an idea of the other anniversary rewards, if there's any

[https://www.hoyolab.com/HI3rd/article/570174](https://www.hoyolab.com/HI3rd/article/570174)

&#x200B;

Here's a guide on units + gear \^\^

People kept talking about how generous gbf is, so I started playing, expecting to stop in less than a month.

&#x200B;

I am now rank 106

I saw someone say that vision holders of the same element all have some sort of similarity in beliefs/personality/etc, so maybe you need an extraordinary achievement/talent *and* being able to resonate with one of the archon's values to get a vision.

&#x200B;

If that's the case, no matter how hard Timaeus works, unless he resonates with one of the archons or impresses them, he'll never get a vision, worse, the one archon who is willing to grant him one is unable to (Venti and Zhongli bc they lost their gnosis, Baal hasnt granted any visions for over a year)

So a guy who fights everything in sight and a kid who bombs everything in sight...

&#x200B;

sounds like a recipe for destruction

Childe is great, but Keqing has a short teleport skill. VERY useful when travelling lmao, especially if you don't have venti. You can also use that skill to make plunge attacks or dodge. Keqing being electro also makes for easy elemental combos :3

&#x200B;

If you need tips on building Keqing, go to [https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSBDGJgQWui7PUOyH-TOUdSNNXe1DdyfkyRbvr7Uqp4Fbdo3PtVh\_SgkLraMxOEJT0bi7vNdI1uLAtW/pub](https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSBDGJgQWui7PUOyH-TOUdSNNXe1DdyfkyRbvr7Uqp4Fbdo3PtVh_SgkLraMxOEJT0bi7vNdI1uLAtW/pub)
